/*
 * ModUpLv features in Hung_By_Son (docs/HUNG_BY_SON_MODUPLV_PORT.md):
 *  - Tấn công đặc biệt + Tấn công quái thường: ModUpLv's attack loop (K154.K067) runs from the
 *    canvas loop once per 28ms of real time whatever the game speed: the highest learned skill
 *    that has MP, no cooldown and targets goes straight to the serializer with the 20 nearest
 *    living monsters of the whole map (range 20000000); no cast, animation or walking.
 *    With Tấn công đặc biệt ON, items on the ground are picked up map-wide (K154.K157).
 *  - Auto đánh > Tấn công quái thường OFF: a Special send of Auto đánh/Farm keeps its native list.
 *  - Cài Đặt Cấu Hình > Auto Lửa Thiêng: on the map/zone where it was enabled, while an auto runs,
 *    use "Lửa thiêng" when no fire stands on the map, "Bình dầu" when the fire is below level 4.
 *  - MOD menu > Phó bản / mê cung: Ngã Tư Tử Thần (entry modes + Hoàn thành phó bản),
 *    Làng Phủ Sương, Auto Mê cung. Packets, maps, NPC ids, coordinates and dialog texts are
 *    ModUpLv's; its frame cadence (28ms) is kept in real time: 30 frames = 840ms, 50 = 1400ms,
 *    5 = 140ms.
 *
 * Markers @~suffix@ expand to the 100-character obfuscated HBS names. CLDC 1.1 APIs only;
 * compiled with --release 7 against the input JAR and stored as class version 48.
 */
